ToUint128Test
├── when x is zero
│   └── it should return zero
├── when x is within uint128 range
│   ├── when x equals 1
│   │   └── it should return 1
│   ├── when x equals type(uint128).max
│   │   └── it should return type(uint128).max
│   └── when x is random value within range
│       └── it should return the same value as uint128
└── when x exceeds uint128 range
    ├── when x equals type(uint128).max + 1
    │   └── it should revert with MathUtilsMaxUint128Overflow
    ├── when x equals type(uint256).max
    │   └── it should revert with MathUtilsMaxUint128Overflow
    └── when x is random value above range
        └── it should revert with MathUtilsMaxUint128Overflow 